 Absent count the days of the period; Late counts the days marked late.","E salary is the pay for the shifts earned (Shifts x Rate / shift) plus any HR bonus.","Advance is the advance recovered from this period's pay (an advance balance still owed is not listed).","ESI / EF is the ESI deduction. ESI and PF are deducted only from Co Emp workers (Employees > Co Emp), by the rules of Settings > PF & ESI, from the first 50% of the period pay. TDS is deducted only from workers on the TDS list: the TDS percentage set for them of the period pay (it is 0 for everybody else).","Others is the late deduction plus any deduction HR added; Total Deduction = ESI / EF + PF + TDS + Advance + Others; NET = E salary - Total Deduction."]}